{"notice_id":47365117,"sections":[{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0000","values":[{"field_id":"BT-145-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2026-09-28"},{"field_id":"BT-1451-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2026-09-28"},{"field_id":"BT-150-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"2000091234 Deutsche Bundesbank, EVARTeS M7, Fil. Chemnitz, Technische Ausrüstung, zusätzliche Leistungen"},{"field_id":"OPT-316-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0000"}]},{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0000","values":[{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0000"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"2000091234 Deutsche Bundesbank, EVARTeS M7, Fil. Chemnitz, Technische Ausrüstung, zusätzliche Leistungen"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"InternalID","type":"id","value":"2000091234"},{"code":"services","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Im Projekt EVARTeS M7 in der Filiale Chemnitz ist das Ingenieurbüro INP Ingenieure GmbH, Leipzig mit den  Planungsleistungen Technische Ausrüstung beauftragt. Im Rahmen des Projektfortschrittes sind zusätzliche  Leistungen erforderlich, die zum Zeitpunkt der Beauftragung nicht ersichtlich waren."},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Es gelten die Fristen des § 160 Abs. 3 GWB."},{"code":"performance","field_id":"OPT-060-Lot","list":"conditions","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-111-Lot-FiscalLegis","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"unused-id"},{"field_id":"OPT-112-Lot-EnvironLegis","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"unused-id"},{"field_id":"OPT-113-Lot-EmployLegis","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"unused-id"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"touchpoint","type":"id","value":"TPO-0000"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0000","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"991-80008-08"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0001","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#1","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"t:022894990"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0002","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#2","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"HRB-Nr 27753"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-0003","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#3","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"002","type":"id","value":"0204:994-DOEVD-83"}]},{"kind":"ContractModification","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractModification#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-1501(c)-Contract","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"CON-0000"},{"field_id":"BT-1501(n)-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"ojs-notice-id","type":"id","value":"999999-2017"},{"code":"add-wss","field_id":"BT-200-Contract","list":"modification-justification","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-201-Contract","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Im Rahmen des Projektes wurden bei der Einstellung des Freikühlbetriebs an der neuen Kälteerzeugung hydraulische Mängel im bestehenden Kältenetz festgestellt. Um einen ordentlichen Anlagenbetrieb einzustellen, musste das Kältenetz umgebaut und die bestehende Regelung angepasst werden. Hierfür musste zusätzlich eine Bestandsaufnahme sowie Planung und Bauüberwachung der Bereiche ausgeführt werden.  Die Leistungen waren zu Beginn des Bauens im Bestand nicht vorhersehbar und konnten nur durch das mit der Planung und Bauüberwachung vertraglich gebundene Ingenieurbüro  INP Ingenieure GmbH erbracht werden, da die Leistungen unmittelbar mit den bereits erbrachten Planungen und Bauleistungen verbunden sind, auf diese aufbauen und im Projektablauf integriert  waren.  Eine  Beauftragung  eines  anderen  Ingenieurbüros  wäre  mit  erheblichen Schwierigkeiten und beträchtlichen Zusatzkosten verbunden, da eine umfassende Einarbeitung in die bereits im Projekt EVARTeS erbrachten Planungs- und Bauleistungen sowie in die örtlichen Gegebenheiten erforderlich wäre."},{"field_id":"BT-202-Contract","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Hierbei handelt es sich um zusätzliche Leitungen im Projekt."}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0000"}]},{"kind":"LocalLegalBasisWithID","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-LocalLegalBasisWithID#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vgv"}]},{"kind":"LotPlacePerformance","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotPlacePerformance#0","values":[{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-5141-Lot","list":"country","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"LotResultContractReference","parent_section_id":"RES-0000","section_id":"ND-LotResultContractReference#0","values":[{"field_id":"OPT-315-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0000"}]},{"kind":"LotResultTenderReference","parent_section_id":"RES-00